     '{"description":"VALUES_FOUND with, per term, found, value (the stored value to type), matched_by (VALUE or ALIAS), ambiguous, alias (codes an alias names, with names and alias type) and candidates (values whose code or name contains the term, with names); kind, source and complete of the column''s value list; or REJECTED NO_VALUE_LIST. Through SQL Governor /v1/catalog/search-values (the value dictionary: CHECK lists, static tables, registered entities, reference codes, AI_column_catalog.entity_name names, AI_entity_alias)."}'::jsonb,
     'ORCHESTRATOR', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40000, 200, 40000, NULL,
